{"name":"Secret Passage","hex":"#372a05","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"secret","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A piece of knowledge that is hidden and intended to be kept hidden. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The key or principle by which something is made clear; the knack."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make or keep secret.","To hide secretly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/secret"},{"term":"passage","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A paragraph or section of text or music with particular meaning.","Part of a path or journey."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To pass something, such as a pathogen or stem cell, through a host or medium.","To make a passage, especially by sea; to cross."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/passage"}],"entries":[{"title":"Secret Passage","blocks":[{"text":"Secret Passage is a 2004 film directed by Ademir Kenović. It was written by Kenović and Olivier Bonas. The film stars John Turturro, Katherine Borowitz, Tara Fitzgerald, and Hannah Taylor-Gordon. In the United Kingdom, the film is mostly known as The Lion's Mouth."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_Passage"},{"title":"Secret passage","blocks":[{"text":"Secret passages, also commonly referred to as hidden passages or secret tunnels, are hidden routes used for stealthy travel, escape, or movement of people and goods. They are sometimes found inside buildings, leading to secret rooms."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/26/Rome_passetto_night_inside.jpg/330px-Rome_passetto_night_inside.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_passage"},{"title":"Secrecy","blocks":[{"text":"Secrecy is the practice of hiding information from certain individuals or groups who do not have the \"need to know\", perhaps while sharing it with other individuals. That which is kept hidden is known as the secret."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/If_you_talk_too_much%2C_this_man_may_die.jpg/330px-If_you_talk_too_much%2C_this_man_may_die.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secrecy"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Bran_castel_secret_passage.jpg/500px-Bran_castel_secret_passage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Bran_castel_secret_passage.jpg/1280px-Bran_castel_secret_passage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Bran_castel_secret_passage.jpg/500px-Bran_castel_secret_passage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A secret passage in Bran Castle, a 14th-century fortress in Romania","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABran_castel_secret_passage.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapclosed.jpg/330px-VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapclosed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapclosed.jpg/330px-VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapclosed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVietnamCuChiTunnelstrapclosed.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapopen.jpg/330px-VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapopen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapopen.jpg/330px-VietnamCuChiTunnelstrapopen.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_